


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_3b37d2a6:


    "——多谢款待。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_123c0fa6:


    "锅中已经一干二净，大家都吃饱喝足了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_56bbf98b:



    voice "2SA_0353"
    sachiko "「今天谢谢各位了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_8d5a6488:


    "说着，祥子起了身。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_7de26e5a:



    voice "2FU_0499"
    fumi "「我马上收拾好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_70282d9d:



    voice "2SA_0354"
    sachiko "「没关系的，小文，我来」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_9a8d7a33:


    "祥子制止了开始收拾桌子上的餐具的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_8d45ec8e:



    voice "2FU_0500"
    fumi "「咦，没关系吗？要洗的东西还不少哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_e67caf9c:



    voice "2SA_0355"
    sachiko "「嗯，我会慢慢洗的。比起这个，我可以把她托付给你吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a108933c:


    "祥子苦笑着，她的视线落到了——"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_e06db259:



    voice "2MI_0479"
    miyako "「呼——呼——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a9597579:


    "趴在桌子上睡得正香的圣夜子身上。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_6b53c493:



    voice "2SA_0356"
    sachiko "「吃了就睡。她的身体是真的实诚啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_7fd3b749:



    voice "2SA_0357"
    sachiko "「圣夜夜？回房间睡去」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_fa6dca4f:



    voice "2MI_0480"
    miyako "「呼——呼——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_87c4ff03:


    "不管是和她说话还是摇她的肩膀，她都没有起来的意思。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_de391718:



    voice "2RI_0588"
    rin "「进入了熟睡模式呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_30d815b7:



    voice "2SA_0358"
    sachiko "「真没办法……哟呵」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_593ab471:


    "将胳膊从圣夜子胁侧伸入，把她抱了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_486f3174:



    voice "2SA_0359"
    sachiko "「那可以拜托你们把她带到房间里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_31b2b763:



    voice "2RI_0589"
    rin "「明白」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_ef186582:


    "伦正准备从祥子手上收下圣夜子……"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_8f978375:



    voice "2RI_0590"
    rin "「这可不行啊。圣夜夜抱得这么紧不肯松手」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_2bb6d773:


    "不知不觉间圣夜子的两只胳膊牢牢地锁住了祥子的腰部。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_6802b5f8:



    voice "2SA_0360"
    sachiko "「真是的～这孩子～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_e2b9f6e0:



    voice "2HI_0576"
    hina "「这样下去不就只能让祥子姐搬她了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_96b3bc5d:



    voice "2SA_0361"
    sachiko "「……是啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_9291ed3c:


    "祥子脸上写满了放弃。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_d791f9c6:



    voice "2RI_0591"
    rin "「泼点水把她叫醒？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_19ec0894:



    voice "2FU_0501"
    fumi "「不能那么做哦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_f54db4e1:



    voice "2RI_0592"
    rin "「我开玩笑的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_f65a846d:



    voice "2SA_0362"
    sachiko "「那阳菜亲，能不能帮我开下门？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_3390d809:



    voice "2HI_0577"
    hina "「好的～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_cf7d0a36:


    "被圣夜子紧紧抱住的祥子摇摇晃晃地向四人的房间走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_5a849175:


    "阳菜她们一边欣慰地看着她的背影，一边跟在身后。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_c1d9b352:



    voice "2FU_0502"
    fumi "「呵呵，总觉得挺不错的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_73e3572d:



    voice "2HI_0578"
    hina "「嗯。相亲相爱的姐妹的感觉呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_dce2d422:



    voice "2RI_0593"
    rin "「不是母女吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_ef65a2db:



    voice "2SA_0363"
    sachiko "「伦，我都听到了哦。等会你要不要洗锅～？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_bd64b306:



    voice "2RI_0594"
    rin "「哟，美女姐妹！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_a_bd3f114b:



    voice "2SA_0364"
    sachiko "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_7c56341b:



    voice "2HI_0579"
    hina "「叫醒她吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_f8401c00:



    voice "2SA_0365"
    sachiko "「算了啦。就这样让她睡吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_5a895894:


    "祥子制止住正准备抱起圣夜子的伦等人。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_2ba5d892:



    voice "2SA_0366"
    sachiko "「等东西洗完了就叫她起来，大家先回去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_7b8df6df:



    voice "2RI_0595"
    rin "「别对她做恶作剧哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_d5cf06c3:



    voice "2SA_0367"
    sachiko "「嘻嘻嘻」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_a3cc9ced:



    voice "2HI_0580"
    hina "「喂！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_9b254690:



    voice "2SA_0368"
    sachiko "「我不会做的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_720ca3df:


    "祥子目送三人回房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_ee8f2c37:



    voice "2FU_0503"
    fumi "「回到房间之后要准备去洗澡呢。火锅的味道都沾到身上了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_95a411f3:



    voice "2RI_0596"
    rin "「哎～好麻烦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_ebf0fe8d:



    voice "2FU_0504"
    fumi "「不行的啦，毕竟头发长」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_13bc019c:



    voice "2RI_0597"
    rin "「我一大早去」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_332e5b5f:



    voice "2HI_0581"
    hina "「骗子！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_92d1ae2e:



    voice "2FU_0505"
    fumi "「那等圣夜子醒来的时候，再来接她去澡堂吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_8520a85d:



    voice "2SA_0369"
    sachiko "「好哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_b_bb42397d:


    "看着三人回到房间，祥子慢慢地从口袋里拿出烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_b361b42d:



    voice "2MI_0481"
    miyako "「我，是不是被恶作剧了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_98af8381:



    voice "2SA_0370"
    sachiko "「咳咳」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_e4f8a42e:


    "祥子被呛到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_1b422c1b:



    voice "2SA_0371"
    sachiko "「你什么时候起来的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_4a10a3c0:



    voice "2MI_0482"
    miyako "「我倒是无所谓」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_bea20538:



    voice "2SA_0372"
    sachiko "「……你睡迷糊了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_f63d7725:



    voice "2MI_0483"
    miyako "「很早之前就醒了。如果不是梦的话」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_4e75ad40:


    "祥子叹了口气，把烟收了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_5b5bd046:



    voice "2SA_0373"
    sachiko "「既然起来了就赶紧回房间」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_f31eb3bf:



    voice "2MI_0484"
    miyako "「那副画，是什么时候画的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_5c60774d:



    voice "2SA_0374"
    sachiko "「……保密」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_271c7430:



    voice "2MI_0485"
    miyako "「我，有那样笑过吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_1ef3e2de:



    voice "2SA_0375"
    sachiko "「画得不像。我画得不好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_0734030d:



    voice "2MI_0486"
    miyako "「没有那回事。我很开心」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_5c5d8ed3:



    voice "2SA_0376"
    sachiko "「开心？为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_32ee5e0f:



    voice "2MI_0487"
    miyako "「因为你说自己只会画喜欢的东西」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_121f1c91:



    voice "2SA_0377"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_c087fd95:



    voice "2MI_0488"
    miyako "「能再让我看一下吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_aa326e8c:


    "圣夜子还没说完就站了起来，准备从柜子上取下画板。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_d6dcfa39:



    voice "2SA_0378"
    sachiko "「啊，喂！别随便碰！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_01ebc551:


    "祥子慌慌张张地跑进屋子准备阻止她。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_1d94c682:



    voice "2MI_0489"
    miyako "「啊……哇哇？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_aaa8d4a1:


    "抢断一般的姿势使圣夜子失去了平衡。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_3f33a221:



    voice "2MI_0490"
    miyako "「今天是个经常摔跤的日子呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_d51bdd8a:



    voice "2SA_0379"
    sachiko "「真是的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_5a50ef5f:


    "祥子在圣夜子身下叹气。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_4a358396:



    voice "2MI_0491"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_4cfe82f0:


    "圣夜子一直盯着祥子看。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_a33e8ab4:



    voice "2SA_0380"
    sachiko "「什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_5b860d8c:



    voice "2MI_0492"
    miyako "「可以恶作剧吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_d307a117:



    voice "2SA_0381"
    sachiko "「……你是要做什么恶作剧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_8813dbc4:



    voice "2MI_0493"
    miyako "「像你一直对她们做的那些？或者是她们恋人间做的那些？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_3ecdacd5:



    voice "2SA_0382"
    sachiko "「好了好了，玩笑就开到这里——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_92eb95c8:


    "祥子正准备站起来，圣夜子却不起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_e97c087d:



    voice "2MI_0494"
    miyako "「那个时候，为什么到一半停下来了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_df7eb3da:



    voice "2SA_0383"
    sachiko "「我不是说了吗，那只是玩笑而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_d1c34789:



    voice "2MI_0495"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_82615ec9:


    "脸上浮现出些许失落的表情。但是下一个瞬间——"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_ee6c2fbb:



    voice "2MI_0496"
    miyako "「可以继续吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_cdc83659:



    voice "2SA_0384"
    sachiko "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_06469742:



    voice "2MI_0497"
    miyako "「我可以做恶作剧吗？嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_e3909b17:


    "祥子再一次被推倒。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_c6fc8a17:



    voice "2SA_0385"
    sachiko "「喂——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_b26ea6fa:


    "圣夜子慢慢把脸凑到跟前。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_f54ccabc:



    voice "2HI_0582"
    hina "「呜哇！祥子姐被狮子袭击了！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_c_5e813152:


    "——今夜到此为止。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_0f71b6b5:



    voice "2SA_0386"
    sachiko "「哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_ada41e0d:


    "祥子被吓了一跳。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_4bc46744:



    voice "2MI_0498"
    miyako "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_f0743a36:


    "不知不觉间圣夜子已经醒来，死死地盯着这边看。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_cb507af6:


    "而且圣夜子抱着那个画板。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_84618206:



    voice "2MI_0499"
    miyako "「这上面画的是谁？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_65883f3f:



    voice "2SA_0387"
    sachiko "「什么是谁，那是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_9a300774:



    voice "2MI_0500"
    miyako "「画板后面写着“Noel”。那是她的名字吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_55122a30:



    voice "2SA_0388"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_5909dd2a:



    voice "2MI_0501"
    miyako "「另外……她是我的原型」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_f285b55b:



    voice "2SA_0389"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_6fb7ef2e:


    "祥子一边思索如何回答，一边点了根烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_62fe2513:



    voice "2MI_0502"
    miyako "「你们认识啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_29ccf700:



    voice "2SA_0390"
    sachiko "「碰巧，吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_8c04e151:



    voice "2MI_0503"
    miyako "「居然还有这种偶然」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_b6581d11:



    voice "2SA_0391"
    sachiko "「因为你并不相信会有这种偶然」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_51578405:



    voice "2MI_0504"
    miyako "「Noel是怎样的人？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_31bc861b:



    voice "2SA_0392"
    sachiko "「和你一模一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_45d1e356:



    voice "2MI_0505"
    miyako "「毕竟是我的原型……性格也和我一样吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_07571ea8:



    voice "2SA_0393"
    sachiko "「完全不……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_fdea0d39:



    voice "2MI_0506"
    miyako "「是吗。那么——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_9ba11a56:


    "圣夜子随后也天真无邪地发问。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_a0940985:



    voice "2MI_0507"
    miyako "「她的制服是圣叶的——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_2fcc1e45:



    voice "2SA_0394"
    sachiko "「你知道了打算干啥？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_39e84d8c:


    "和圣夜子不同，祥子的表情并不明朗。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_405eb20c:



    voice "2MI_0508"
    miyako "「因为想知道你喜欢的人的事情」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_df4aeb7a:



    voice "2SA_0395"
    sachiko "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_cbcf3150:



    voice "2MI_0509"
    miyako "「你说过，自己只画喜欢的东西」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_c9e42a10:



    voice "2SA_0396"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_d5ef2fb2:



    voice "2MI_0510"
    miyako "「邀请你降到地上的是Noel吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_9bd30b77:



    voice "2SA_0397"
    sachiko "「……你为什么会这么想？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_c853f354:



    voice "2MI_0511"
    miyako "「和名字写在一起的日期是五年前」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_b1dfea59:



    voice "2SA_0398"
    sachiko "「……对」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_23ae53b8:



    voice "2MI_0512"
    miyako "「但是，最大的理由还是因为这幅非常美的画」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_fc60d4c3:



    voice "2SA_0399"
    sachiko "「这是我下来之后画的第一幅画……画得不好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_74d4d005:



    voice "2MI_0513"
    miyako "「不，画得不错。看得出来你在画很重要的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_eb61b047:



    voice "2MI_0514"
    miyako "「我在想要是画的是我该多好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_3f2d1892:



    voice "2SA_0400"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_64c3805a:



    voice "2MI_0515"
    miyako "「听了你说吸烟的事情，我还以为是年纪更大的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_df0ab283:



    voice "2SA_0401"
    sachiko "「……那家伙，是个不良啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_8157a521:



    voice "2MI_0516"
    miyako "「是吗？于是现在Noel呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_84f3f729:



    voice "2SA_0402"
    sachiko "「她现在……在很远的地方」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_85a8384a:



    voice "2MI_0517"
    miyako "「很远的地方？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_a201d0e0:



    voice "2RI_0598"
    rin "「啊，起来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_a4d30a20:



    voice "2HI_0583"
    hina "「圣夜子，去澡堂了哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_b2afd0a6:



    voice "2MI_0518"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_14_d_cec75c10:



